OL,3,GNEWSANursery staff walk out over
OL,4,Apensions dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff from six nurseries in South
OL,7,FYorkshire have gone on strike in a
OL,8,Fdispute over pensions.
OL,10,FMore than 30 staff walked out on Monday
OL,11,Fin protest against a move by Barnsley
OL,12,FCouncil to transfer the running of the
OL,13,Fnurseries to the private sector.
OL,15,FThe council said the decision was made
OL,16,Fto protect jobs and retain services for
OL,17,Ffamilies, but early years workers said
OL,18,Fit would result in a reduced pension.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
