OL,3,GNEWSANursery staff walk out over
OL,4,Apensions dispute
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking on behalf of workers on the
OL,7,Fpicket line in Grimethorpe, GMB union
OL,8,Forganiser Vicky Austin said: "They do
OL,9,Fit with a heavy heart, they absolutely
OL,10,Flove the work, they do this job not for
OL,11,Fthe money because they're already low
OL,12,Fpaid.
